知りたいその秘密ミステリア
that secret, mysterious side you want to know.

220
00:25:14,016 --> 00:25:16,636
抜けてるところさえ彼女のエリア
Even your clumsy side is part of your domain,

221
00:25:16,936 --> 00:25:19,036
完璧で嘘つきな君は
you, perfect and full of lies,

222
00:25:19,206 --> 00:25:22,106
